WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.560
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.650
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:14.070
<i>My childhood friend Koharu-chan set off for Italy.</i>

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:18.080
<i>Koharu-chan, I feel lost and lonely.</i>

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.540
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.330
At attention!

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:28.090
We have a schoolwide assembly today. 
Therefore, I will conduct a uniform inspection.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.090
Good morning!

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.090
Good morning.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.300
This was Kasumi's room, I believe.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.810
Wake up.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.230
Oh no!

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.480
I'm sorry!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:51.990
You should have received prior notice of today's uniform inspection.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:56.110
Come see me privately after the assembly.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:57.370
Understood...

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:58.990
Ladies.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.580
Is autumn the season of reading? Or perhaps of eating?

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:04.750
Neither, I say.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.000
It is the season of Fall Fest.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:11.920
The theme of Fall Fest is this—three-person units.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:17.090
Believe it or not, you can form any unit you want regardless of year or class. {it's just goofy}

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:20.640
Your task will be to sing a predetermined set piece.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.100
The entry deadline is in one week.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.930
You've got more than enough time!

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:30.820
You'll find that unit activities hold a different magnificence from your standard Aikatsu.{I mean, I guess, but werugh?}

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:34.940
Those who are up to the challenge are encouraged to step forward.

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:38.070
<i>Three-person units...</i>

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:21.930
Ako-chan.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.930
Solo training? Now, aren't you dedicated.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:28.680
Yeah, I just can't calm down unless I'm doing something.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.520
What are your plans for Fall Fest, Yume?

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.440
I want to concentrate on practicing right now.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.320
So I'm going to sit this one out.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.940
I-I see.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.650
What about you, Ako-chan?

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.450
M-Me?

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:47.240
Naturally, I've been approached by many a prospective partner.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.450
I figured!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.120
I'll be wishing you luck.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.710
Bye, I've got a lesson to get to.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.460
I wouldn't expect someone as 
responsible as you to oversleep.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.470
What's gotten into you?

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:06.970
Last night, I ended up training for far too long...

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:10.680
But that's just an excuse. 
I'll accept my punishment.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.350
I like your resolve. Very well.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.610
It's Punishment Time!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.940
First, one week of hallway cleaning.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.950
Second, one week of kitchen duty.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:28.080
Third, form a unit with me and Yozora.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.540
Now, which punishment would you prefer?

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.460
What a surprise.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.000
Who'd have thought you'd initiate this, Tsubasa?

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:44.300
Um, why did you choose us?

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.220
Right, I'd like to know as well.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:50.510
I want nothing less than to win Fall Fest.

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:53.600
Then, I thought about who my ideal partners would be.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:58.400
Looking back, I couldn't get your show at Summer Fest out of my mind.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:05.070
On that stage, the light of your performance dazzled me like never before.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:08.070
The power of your bond was resounding.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:13.080
It inspired me to want to unlock the next level of that power.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:17.540
I believe this unit holds the key.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.340
Won't you test that possibility with me?

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.640
I couldn't possibly refuse.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.510
Please take us with you.

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:30.970
I'm glad to hear it.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.100
Still, let me clean the hallways as well.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:41.110
Forming a unit with you makes me so happy I don't think it would end up as much of a punishment.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.320
Understood.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:50.070
Putting two S4 members together is way too OP!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.240
You think so?

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.250
Fine, it looks like I'm joining up with Hime-chan!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.790
Hime left for a faraway show yesterday, 
and she won't make it back until after Fall Fest.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.080
No way!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.750
But I'm not gonna lose!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.750
Down with S4!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.720
Yuzu, aren't you one of us too?

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:08.380
Tsubasa, thank you again.

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:13.890
Fall Fest is a perfect opportunity for her to learn the fun of unit activities.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:18.140
I'm sure this will be a good experience for Mahiru.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.270
She's continuing to grow.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.770
But there's still so much more for her to learn.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.650
I want to teach her what I can.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.070
With all my remaining time here.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:35.540
Let our very first unit meeting ever commence!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.910
Yay!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.620
Thank you for your time.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.620
Excuse me, girls?

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.880
Don't you have a "yay!" or an "okay!" in you?

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:44.920
No.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:48.340
It's no fair that only you two get to be on the same page!

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:54.140
Let's skip the formalities and decide on a concept for our unit.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.720
A concept...

00:06:55.720 --> 00:07:00.560
Put simply, we want to figure out what kind of unit we want to be.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.900
Exactly.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.690
In terms of fashion, Mahiru and I like sexy styles.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.570
Tsubasa, you prefer cool clothes, right?

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:16.080
Appearance is a bit shallow for a concept, but we should try to incorporate it.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.250
<i>This feels legitimate.</i>

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:21.580
Okay Mahiru, go ahead and tell us any ideas you've got.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:26.340
Right, the important thing is to say everything that comes to mind.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.590
Um, in that case...

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:34.850
Something mature... and not just subdued, but girlish as well.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.350
In a word...

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.100
Something like this?

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:44.810
That's it!

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.360
Adult cute. I like it!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.070
Yeah!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.360
Let's decide on a unit name.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.110
I wonder how that's usually done.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:58.740
One common method is to find a shared trait among the members and use that.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:03.370
Let's see... another is to use parts of everyone's names.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:07.000
Shared traits and names...

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:15.890
Sky!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:21.480
A unit name that asserts our desire to take off to the skies and shine...

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.150
Sky-Girl! {guess it has to have the dash}{shouldn't it must eek all caps or serifs too then?}{only special units get that}

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.610
What do you think?

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.530
That's wonderful!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.860
I agree!

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:38.740
It really feels like we've formed a unit now.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.540
I get you.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.790
What about our outfits?{just because händle twice so frequently irks}

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:47.170
It would be nice to design something just for our unit with Dress Make. {make make}

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:51.420
Would you let me handle creating all of our stage dresses?

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:56.430
I don't mind. This should be a good experience for you as well.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.050
Good idea. I'll leave it in your hands, Mahiru.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.310
Thank you very much.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.140
There won't be a moment to rest starting tomorrow.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:09.270
Yes, you should look forward to the special lessons Tsubasa and I have prepared.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.820
Okay.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:15.820
What will I do for Fall Fest?

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.330
Y-Yuzu-senpai!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.830
M-My sincerest apologies!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:30.750
I'm totally okay. More importantly...

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.860
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.820
What are you wearing?

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:58.360
They're called Lun Lun Body Makers.{koi no majikaru mikurun-run}

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:00.990
Lun Lun Body Maker!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.950
L-Lun Lun?

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.500
You're supposed to dance while wearing them.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:11.500
And then like magic, you build muscles in all the right places for an ideal body.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.340
We used these during a training camp way back when. Do you remember?

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:20.510
Of course. We could barely move at first.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:24.560
Dave-sensei was so strict with us back then.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.560
Do not crumble!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:34.400
Instead, use your impassioned heart to explode!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.360
I want to be able to use it too!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.740
It's so powerful!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.290
Now try to Lun Lun!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.500
Lun Lun!

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.260
I-It's tight...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.380
Do your best!

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.970
You mustn't give up!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.510
I know!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.640
The three of us...

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.640
are going to win!

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.640
Lun... Lun Lun! {who is she, Freyja?}

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.360
We can't let Mahiru show us up.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.900
All right, let's push even harder!

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:46.260
You did well to keep up with us.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.520
Yes, I'm so proud of you, Mahiru.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:52.060
Thank you for everything you've done.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.440
There's only one day until Fall Fest.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.270
Right!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:12:00.150
I swear I'll create us the perfect dresses.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:03.530
They're just not quite complete yet.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:06.240
Would you give me some more time?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.450
Of course.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:12.540
The most important thing is how it expresses all three of us in a unit together.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.330
I know your sense of fashion won't let us down.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.250
Thank you!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.050
Ai...katsu!

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.800
Aikatsu!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:22.630
Nijino.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.720
Anna-sensei. Good evening.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:28.060
You seem to be working hard these days.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:31.810
No, not at all. And I still have a long way to go.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.690
Sakuraba took a leave of absence to go home.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.770
It's just for a short while, though.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.070
She said she wanted to focus on training.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:43.110
I see...

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.820
Do all the things you can with all you've got.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.740
However, don't go past your limits.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:49.830
Right.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.830
<i>Rola's working hard too.</i>

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:59.250
<i>I need to step it up as well.</i>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.840
<i>How do I express all three of us?</i>

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:10.850
<i>Onee-chan's definitely needs to be sexy.</i>

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:14.060
<i>Yeah, this suits her perfectly!</i>

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:20.230
<i>The best color for Tsubasa-senpai has got to be a shade of blue.</i>

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.240
Yes, these came out great!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:30.080
Training camp?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.580
Come on in!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.960
Tsubasa's already here.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.580
Oh, okay.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.090
Mahiru! Good work today.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.300
S-Same to you.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.510
First things first, change into these.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.470
What?

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.970
Please, eat to your heart's content!

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:54.390
I made them all myself!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.440
Don't mind if I do!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.730
I-I will too.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.070
Delicious!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.360
We said the same thing.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:11.280
Well it's true, they really are delicious.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.880
I love this scene.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.380
It feels like my heart is breaking.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.300
Stop, I can't watch any longer!

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:38.640
This aroma oil has a deep calming effect.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:49.070
Wait, this is just a regular pajama party!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:51.070
Yes, and?

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:54.410
Yes, and this is supposed to be a training camp!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:57.540
That's right, this is absolutely a part of our training.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.290
Wh-What?

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:02.080
The most important thing for a unit

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.960
is for each of its lights to shine with their hearts as one.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:08.260
Hearts?

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.340
Yep!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:14.850
Being with one another and doing things together is the best way to do that.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.140
That's why I wanted us to have a pajama party.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:21.980
It's the same reason we all did that harsh training together.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.860
Right now, we all have the same dream.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.610
The same dream...

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:34.990
Let's combine our abilities and make sure to win tomorrow.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:49.970
<i>The most important thing is how it expresses all three of us in a unit together.</i>

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:03.190
It's begun! Four Star Academy's Fall Fest!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:07.270
Ten units have stepped forward and entered this event.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:11.320
Leading us off is Yozora, Tsubasa, and Mahiru's unit!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.780
Come on! Sky-Girl!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:21.290
But before they go on, let's interview them while they're still on standby.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.710
I'd like to ask Tamagorou-sensei to take it away!

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.590
Will you select a replacement?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.010
Or shall I cancel your entry?

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:38.600
We will do neither! Mahiru will definitely be here!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:42.600
Unfortunately, time has run out.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.850
This is it.

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.730
I'll cancel your entry.

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:48.730
Sorry I'm late!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.070
Mahiru!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.990
I apologize for cutting it this close.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:56.370
Please let us change our dresses!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:00.790
When I heard that we should make our hearts as one,

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:05.370
I was inspired to make dresses that could make our individualities shine together.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:09.420
The natural result was these Romance Kiss Doll Coords.{did we decide to capitalize coord}{for this season}

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.750
What do you think?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.010
These dresses are the best, Mahiru!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:13.880
I agree.

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:16.010
We'll bring out their full potential.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.890
Sky-Girl!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.390
Fly together!

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:58.860
Mahiru-san shone bright enough not to be outdone by the others.{I don't remember, are we a shined group or a shone group}

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:04.990
Bathed in the light of S4, Kasumi Mahiru's own brilliance was intensified.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:08.490
You're saying that she rode higher in the wake of their trail.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:12.370
Yes, and that is exactly why I can't get enough of unit events.{or "discontinue" if you want a higher-register word}{there, I made it more clear for you}

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:19.380
<i>Fall Fest must have started.</i>

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:28.390
Onee-chan, Tsubasa-senpai, thank you so much.

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:33.020
I've never felt so accomplished before in my entire life.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:37.730
This is the result of bringing the three of our hearts together.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.020
Right!

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:44.780
I first learned of it thanks to our unit activities as S4.

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:48.530
I'm glad we were able to share this with Mahiru.

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:50.530
Yeah, me too!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:54.870
I'll never forget the time we shared on stage.

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:06.550
This isn't good enough. I need to work harder.

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:07.760
Oh, yeah?

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:14.560
Yuzu-senpai?

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:13.720
Our legend has just begun!

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:16.720
All that's left is to bust our butts on stage!

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:17.390
Okay!

00:24:17.850 --> 00:24:19.930
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:21.480
Advance, Yuzukoshou! {under the assumption they'll explain exactly what it is next time}

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:24.020
Become the first-star idol!
